## Smart Access Architecture (Official · 2026-07-04)

- **Primary SSoT:** `docs/TITAN_OFFICIAL_ARCHITECTURE.md` · `src/config/titanOfficialArchitecture.js`
- **Hybrid:** Paper · QR · Mobile · NFC(Future) — 병행 · 대체 ❌
- **Smart Access ID:** `NDK://` canonical · `NDK|` legacy alias
- **Paper Mode:** HTL · OUT · INV · DPR 출력 **삭제 금지**
- **Smart Mode:** Smart Access ID → 기존 화면 deep link (설비 QR active · 기타 planned)
- **Smart Workflow:** … → 검사대기 → **검사 → 성적서 → 출고**
- **Route Registry:** `src/config/smartAccessArchitecture.js`
- **QR 출력센터:** 관리자 → QR 출력센터 (planned)

